  "recreation_notes": [
    {
      "line_end": 1,
      "line_start": 1,
      "status": "candidate",
      "text": "L-2 Test 02 pairs printed selectors 1-25 with public addresses 1-25; 16 is a de-energizing lockout step. The slow Test 03 held snapshots display 01-49 for public 1-49 and blank for 50-64; 21 is scanned but physically Not Used. Repeated host pulse writes to 13 are not proof that a one-shot write survives; gameplay demonstrates overwrite, and button 82 makes Test 03 report 13. Six special mappings, flipper synthesis, serve, orbit flash, saucer lock/release, drain and tilt are observed in gameplay. No trace establishes socket quantity, physical location, measured mechanical timing or Wild Texas compatibility. First switch run used 450ms holds and missed multiplexed numerals; sw-slow is its separate 2200ms successor. Raw bundle manifest SHA256 fd5fcad3b957c74c436a4a84106786ee04ae1ae93d8f8e93eb77705741ea9bcd. All ball moves are host stimuli, not ROM-generated switch evidence."
    }
  ],
